{"id":"paisaje","lemma":"paisaje","pos":"noun","rank":3865,"glosses":["landscape (the view of an area of land)","countryside"],"ipa":"/paiˈsaxe/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"paisajes"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/97/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-paisaje.wav","examples":[{"text":"Tomó una foto del precioso paisaje.","en":"He took a picture of the beautiful landscape.","words":[{"g":"to take","l":"tomar"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"photo, photograph"},{"g":"of the"},{"g":"precious"},null]},{"text":"Eres un paisaje para los sentidos.","en":"You're a sight for sore eyes.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/803924","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"for"},{"g":"the / them"},{"g":"sense","l":"sentido"}]},{"text":"Él pinta paisajes frecuentemente.","en":"He often paints landscapes.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/820193","words":[{"g":"he"},{"g":"look, appearance"},null,{"g":"often, frequently"}]},{"text":"El paisaje es realmente espléndido.","en":"The scenery is really splendid.","words":[{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"really"},{"g":"splendid"}]},{"text":"Japón es famoso por la belleza de sus paisajes.","en":"Japan is famous for its scenic beauty.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/599232","words":[{"g":"Japanese"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"well-known, famous"},{"g":"for / by"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"beauty"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"his, her, its, their"},null]}]}